Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:56.80,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}從睡夢中醒來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:02:01.56,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}獨自站在翻開的書頁上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:04.81,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}環顧四周一片茫然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:09.23,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}沒有目的  也沒有出口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:15.11,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}隨後我聽到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:20.41,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}你呼喚著我名字的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:28.63,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}試探著開口  並邁出腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:32.47,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}若我用零碎的節奏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:38.72,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\1a&HFF&\blur10}開始輕聲哼唱  請聽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:47.40,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\1a&HFF&\blur10}讓世界舒緩的聲音傳來耳畔  傳來耳畔  清晨到來
